A||||4||Brandon86SE||Fierosound sighting!||||10||
Z||000000||Brandon86SE||11-17-2001||12:59 AM||||It's been a while since any gatherings for the Calgary club at all, and I haven't been able to make it to anything since the fall Red Deer run.  Last night I was in the passenger seat of my dad's car (2000 Acura 3.2TL) and going Northbound on Macleod Trail, who do I see?  Yup, Tony!  (a.k.a. Fierosound)  He was filling up his car with gas at a station just South of Willy's Drive-In (our regular meeting place).  I have a knack for seeing Fiero's when I'm out, and how could I miss his ride?  Anyway, I wish I coulda stopped to say hi, but we were on the way to the hockey game.<P>On a side note, it was a while ago now, but I saw Voytek while I was driving home from school about a month ago.  He was riding shotgun in a truck/van?  Actually, he saw me.  He leaned out his window and yelled at me.<P>That's been all I've seen of the Calgary guys in the last couple months.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  Hopefully we get our monthly Winter meetings going soon.<P>See ya all soon!<P>Brandon<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
Z||000001||Philphine||11-17-2001||09:54 AM||||i need to start looking up all his post for the subs and instructions. got mine friday.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Raydar||11-17-2001||12:15 PM||||Somebody in my building drove a spotless red 86 GT to work, one day. Left a note, with the Forum address and my phone extension, but never heard from them.<BR>  <BR>Saw an Indy on Peachtree street, within a day or two of Sept. 11. Wondered if it was Songman's. Think he sold it to someone in Atlanta, around that time.<P>There's a guy that works near me that drives a pretty spotless gold 86 or 87 GT. I've seen it twice now. Gave him a big thumbs-up, but was in my Sonoma, so he didn't appreciate where I was coming from.<P>This was all over a period of over a year. Usually, the only time I see other Fieros is when I go to club meetings.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P><BR>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT><p>[This message has been edited by Raydar (edited 11-17-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||avengador1||11-17-2001||12:24 PM||||I saw a silver 2M4 this mornig heading South on RT 8(Connecticut)heading towards Bridgeport just south of Shelton.His car had the headlights stuck up. The guy was in the right lane and I was in the left passing him fast. He gave me a big grin and a thumbs up. I gave him a big wave back. I don't see too many Fieros around here, but when I see them I either honk the horn or wave. Especially if im in my Fiero. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||RiceCooker||11-17-2001||06:29 PM||||Yo Brandon hows it goin?<P>the fiero #'s are dwindling away for the winter.<BR>I took my insurance off at the end of October so you can thank me for this beautiful weather  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">||||reg||1
